# HUMAN website — build-time variables. Copy to .env for a PRIVATE DEVELOPMENT build only.
#
# INVESTOR-FACING BUILD: set NEITHER variable. The waitlist then runs as a demonstration:
# nothing typed into it leaves the browser and no request is made.
#
# Anything starting with PUBLIC_ is written into the pages that visitors download.
# Never put a private key here (for example a Supabase service_role or secret key).
#
# Private testing only: both must be set for the form to send to the site's own function.
# PUBLIC_WAITLIST_MODE=live
# PUBLIC_WAITLIST_ENDPOINT=/api/waitlist
#
# The function's own settings (WAITLIST_ENABLED, SUPABASE_URL, SUPABASE_SECRET_KEY) are NOT build variables and do
# not belong in this file. They are set in Cloudflare; see docs/HUMAN-WAITLIST-BACKEND.md.
